# ── Binaries ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Nothing compiled, packed or downloaded belongs in the history: it bloats
# every clone forever and git can't diff it. vendor/ (DepotDownloader) and
# dist/ are already covered above.
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.node
*.msi
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar
*.gz
*.asar
*.wasm
*.pdb
*.jar
# Design mockups and their source artwork — internal working material, kept
# on disk, out of the repository.
design/
# The app's own icons are the one exception: electron-builder reads them from
# here at package time, so the build does not work without them in the tree.
!apps/desktop/build/icon.ico
!apps/desktop/build/icon.png
!apps/desktop/build/icon-32.png

# ── Credentials ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Belt and braces — no key material or real env file, ever.
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
*.jks
*.keystore
.npmrc
.netrc

# ── Specifications and internal docs ──────────────────────────────────
# Product/protocol specs are not published with the source.
SPEC.md
docs/
*.spec.md
openapi.*
